					<![CDATA[
						 <p>All I can say is wow.<br /> It’s been a long time since something on this site scared me. All the stories of eldrich horrors, of horrible meat effigies, of endless, dark, twisted hallways, somehow don’t come close to the simple horror of this piece. Just a couple murders. But it was all so beautifully executed, with perfect timing.<br /> Wish I could give more than just my +1</p> 
				 	]]>
