					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12277711#post-4323742</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12277711/straight-to-vhs:sunday-dinner#post-4323742</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 06 Aug 2019 14:53:35 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>3146689</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm incredibly and utterly spooked.</p> <p>Pretty enjoyable read. I did understand that the recording was (at least somewhat) real from the start, otherwise it wouldn't be a creepypasta, but the final twist still surprised me.</p> <p>It's interesting to see the content you've <em>cooked</em> for this new format. Hopefully Parawatch will go places.</p> <p><em>There is one thing that bugs me tho&#8230;</em></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Maybe I'm reading too much into it, but those details regarding the recording being not real seemed&#8230; Odd. We know the murders happened for real, but the cameras were still <em>not hidden</em>, there were also some edits in the footage and the murderer somehow knew that the girl will crawl out.</p> <p>So, this leaves me with a question: could it be that victims knew what was coming?</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
